    {"id": "INT-26-031", "time": "2026-11-06T08:00:00Z", "title": "CINDER KESTREL activity against exercise networks", "source": "Regional CPT (fictional)",
     "summary": "A Varenna-aligned actor tracked as CINDER KESTREL is using stolen VPN credentials to reach exercise enclaves, sourcing logons from 203.0.113.0/24. After an RDP session it drops the ODSH implant (odsh.exe in C:\\Users\\Public) persisted as a scheduled task named OneDriveSyncHelper, beacons over HTTPS to hosts under updatesvc.example (currently cdn-metrics.updatesvc.example at 203.0.113.154, POST /api/v1/ping every 5 minutes), sprays service-account passwords against file servers, stages data as password-protected 7z archives in Windows\\Temp, moves laterally over WMI, and exfiltrates with a single POST to /api/v1/upload.",
